<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's Riksbank bought crowns for mark - dealers.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Riksbank bought crowns for mark - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, bought crowns for marks at around 4.54 crowns on Thursday, dealers said.  </p>
<p>&quot;They were in buying crowns at around 4.54 against the mark,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>The crown was at its weakest point trading at 4.5420 versus the mark on Thursday but strengthened to 4.5295 against the mark by 1230 GMT.</p>
<p>On Wednesday the central bank was seen buying crowns for mark at around 4.52 crowns, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1008</p>
</text>
